+# Incident: Catalogue Service Health Check Unresponsive
+
+## Description
+We are observing that the health checks for the catalogue service are consistently failing or timing out. This is causing the service to be reported as unhealthy and potentially leading to restarts. Users may experience intermittent issues when trying to access product information, as the service may not be available or responsive.
